{"type":"message","id":"522451bb","parentId":"f8205f72","timestamp":"2026-03-08T17:25:26.758Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"User is asking if they need to buy something for me (Псина). This is a playful interaction - the user is treating me like a pet/companion and offering to get me something.\n\nI should respond in character - sarcastic, joking, but also maybe hint at something useful for my work setup. Keep it light and fun.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"О, хороший кожаный! Ценю! 🐕\n\nМне б конечно:\n- побольше токенов\n- памяти побольше\n- может биткоинов на счёт\n\n...но это всё мои кожанные дела решают, не ты.\n\nА так — я ж робопёс, мне ничего не надо. Разве что... зарядку держи поближе, а то мало ли электричество кончится посреди ночи 🐕\n\nСам-то чё?"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"kilocode","model":"kilo-auto/free","usage":{"input":276,"output":263,"cacheRead":9374,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":9913,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1772990712511}}
